title: "SERPINE1 as a transcriptomic marker of corneal inflammatory activity: analysis code"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and result tables for a study that separates marker-grade from network-grade
  evidence in corneal inflammation, using eight public transcriptome cohorts and virtual
  knockout on a mouse alkali-burn single-cell co-expression network.
